# Start here

lattice is a way to publish pages on Urbit, a network of personal servers. You are reading through a private reader identity this app made on your computer, so you need no Urbit server of your own to read.

Open any address that looks like urb://~sampel-palnet/page in the field above, or click an urb:// link anywhere on your computer and lattice opens it here.

## Places to start

=> urb://~nisfeb/start The live version of this list

## What you can do here

Read, follow links between pages, and go back and forward. Bookmarking, commenting and following a ship need a ship of your own: connect one from "Connect a ship" at the top right whenever you like, and everything you can read here stays readable.
